Claim 1: They get obsessed with someone/something and disappear from friends for months at a time (hyperfocus)
→ Unsupported — "hyperfocus" as an intense fixation causing social withdrawal for months is not a listed diagnostic feature or associated symptom in DSM-5-TR or ICD-11

